[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1821661681","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/18617#issuecomment-1821661681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18617","id":1821661681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5slFnx","user":{"login":"jakevdp","id":781659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-21T20:52:46Z","updated_at":"2023-11-21T20:52:46Z","body":"Thanks for the report! I think the issue is that pickle always places the loaded array on the default device. You'll have to re-replicate your array in the third case if you want it to be identical to the first two cases.\r\n\r\nSee https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/jax.numpy.html#copying-and-serialization for details.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1821661681/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1822203776","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/18617#issuecomment-1822203776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18617","id":1822203776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5snJ-A","user":{"login":"jbuckman","id":10989937,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTg5OTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10989937?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman","html_url":"https://github.com/jbuckman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-22T06:48:20Z","updated_at":"2023-11-22T06:48:20Z","body":"In this case there is only a single device, so the new X should be default-committed there. I have also tried fixing it further by including the line `X = jax.device_put(X, jax.local_devices()[0])` after `print('Loaded X')`, but to no avail.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1822203776/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1826328186","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/18617#issuecomment-1826328186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/18617","id":1826328186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5s2456","user":{"login":"jbuckman","id":10989937,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTg5OTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10989937?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman","html_url":"https://github.com/jbuckman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jbuckman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-25T13:59:18Z","updated_at":"2023-11-25T13:59:18Z","body":"I found a workaround. Manually removing the extra dimension on the arrays before saving (which I am forced to do on CPU since we cannot donate buffers when reshaping), and then re-invoking `device_put_replicated` after loading, leads to buffers being donated correctly. I guess `device_put_replicated` is doing something important under the hood besides changing the shape and committing to a device.\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef unpack(pt):\r\n    return jax.tree_map(lambda arr: arr[0], pt)\r\n\r\n# This is the function I want to call\r\ndef add1(s):\r\n    return jax.tree_map(lambda x: x + 1, s)\r\n\r\n# This is the input. Adjust the size based on your GPU.\r\n# This number is for an A6000 with XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_MEM_FRACTION=1.\r\nGIANT_ARRAY_SIZE = 6750078228\r\nX = {'w': jnp.arange(GIANT_ARRAY_SIZE, dtype=jnp.float32)}\r\njax.device_put_replicated(X, jax.local_devices())\r\njax.block_until_ready(X)\r\nprint('Created X')\r\n\r\npath = '/tmp/test.pkl'\r\nif os.path.exists(path):\r\n    os.remove(path)\r\nwith open(path, 'wb') as file:\r\n    pickle.dump(unpack(jax.device_put(X, jax.devices('cpu')[0])), file)\r\nprint('Dumped X')\r\ndel X\r\nprint('Deleted X')\r\nwith open(path, 'rb') as file:\r\n    X = pickle.load(file)\r\nprint('Loaded X')\r\n\r\nX = jax.device_put_replicated(X, jax.local_devices())\r\njax.block_until_ready(X)\r\nprint('Put X onto GPU')\r\np_add1 = jax.pmap(add1, axis_name='data_parallel', donate_argnums=0)\r\nX = p_add1(X)\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1826328186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]